    "required_after_json_schema_validation": true,
    "schema_only_acceptance_prohibited": true,
    "tracked_file": "tooling/koaptix/rank_publication/validate_publication_result.py"
  },
  "x-koaptix-semantic-validator-rules": [
    "for SUCCESSFUL_PUBLICATION every expected_* canonical source, version, authorization, membership, affected-universe scalar, array, manifest and digest equals its actual_* peer byte-for-value; all_expected_actual_equal is derived only after every pair passes",
    "canonical_query_version, membership_contract_version, calculation/rule version arrays, market-cap/eligibility/membership source IDs, market-cap/eligibility/combined/selected-input/membership/affected digests, manual_override_allowed, and blocking-review rule/digest are mandatory manifest-vs-recomputed pairs",
    "membership duplicate, fail-closed qualified, unauthorized manual-override, invalid source-contract and blocking-review expected/actual counts are integer zero, not JSON booleans",
    "actual_manual_override_rows is a nonnegative recomputed count and must be zero when actual_manual_override_allowed is false",
    "Transaction A candidate-stage counts/digests equal generation provenance; Transaction B history.source_set_sha256 equals candidate_stage.history_set_sha256 and snapshots.snapshot_vector_sha256 equals candidate_stage.snapshot_vector_sha256, with official counts equal to the candidate stage",
    "publish and rollback event tuples equal pointer_after event/generation/version/time and increment pointer_before version by exactly one",
    "for SUCCESSFUL_PUBLICATION publish_event.plan_run_id/execution_run_id equal identity.plan_run_id/execution_run_id; generation.generation_id equals publish_event.to_generation_id and pointer_after.generation_id; publish_event.from_generation_id equals pointer_before.generation_id; pointer_after.previous_generation_id equals pointer_before.generation_id",
    "for SUCCESSFUL_PUBLICATION identity manifest_run_id/contract/target_date equal the immutable generation authority and nonrevoked manifest plus the same-transaction gate authority verified through read-only completion evidence",
    "for SUCCESSFUL_PUBLICATION generation.surface_components sorted by surface_code are exactly GLOBAL_LATEST and UNIVERSE_SERVICE, equal the immutable DB component rows/counts/full-row digests/component manifests, total_component_rows and combined_surface_manifest_sha256; all affected rows use identity.target_date and cross-surface equality is exact only for snapshot_date,KOREA_ALL,complex_id,rank_all,market_cap_krw,type-normalized share/pct,tier code/label/sort,is_top1000; previous rank/prior date/delta/movement are compared only when predecessor dates are equal",
    "for REJECTED_NO_PUBLICATION pointer_before and pointer_after are byte-for-field equal across generation_id, previous_generation_id, event_id, publication_version and published_at and equal the read-only database singleton completion evidence; pointer_unchanged is derived only after equality and all four official/event/pointer write counts are database-verified zero",
    "a TRANSACTION_A rejection has transaction_a_committed=false, no retained generation and zero retained stage rows; a TRANSACTION_B rejection has transaction_a_committed=true meaning an exact candidate generation is durably present (including exact idempotent reuse), a nonnull retained generation and positive history/snapshot stage rows",
    "for a TRANSACTION_B rejection the retained generation ID/combined manifest/two typed surface components and both retained stage counts equal read-only database completion evidence for identity.execution_run_id and its named nonrevoked manifest; missing or contradictory provenance rejects the result",
    "for PUBLICATION_ROLLED_BACK original_publication_execution_run_id equals identity.execution_run_id, original_publish_event_id equals pointer_before.event_id, rollback_event.plan_run_id equals identity.plan_run_id, and rollback_event.execution_run_id equals rollback_execution_run_id",
    "for PUBLICATION_ROLLED_BACK rollback_event.from_generation_id equals pointer_before.generation_id, rollback_event.to_generation_id equals pointer_after.generation_id, pointer_after.generation_id equals pointer_before.previous_generation_id, and pointer_after.previous_generation_id equals pointer_before.generation_id",
    "canonical rollback target_generation_id equals pointer_after.generation_id; its generation references the named nonrevoked SEALED rank-input-v1 manifest and the serialized required_surface_codes/surface_components/total_component_rows/combined_surface_manifest_sha256 equal the immutable database parent and exactly two GLOBAL_LATEST plus UNIVERSE_SERVICE component rows, including dates or date vector, counts, full-row and component digests, affected-date alignment and common-field equality",
    "bootstrap rollback target_generation_id equals pointer_after.generation_id and source_authority_key selects one whole exact branch: V1 carries GLOBAL_LATEST 2026-07-31/2026-07-30/C560F4...92908/DED5CE...DB6C with combined F2C78A...1DE63; V2 carries GLOBAL_LATEST 2026-08-26/2026-08-25/E62394...B5FCB/B7B230...5FF82 with combined D59ED8...3C1BD; both require the exact shared UNIVERSE_SERVICE null-date/225/40484/6E7BA4...82F7/FB31BF...D8008/A1CCAC...07E2 and total 53981, with no cross-branch mixing"
  ]
